  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供本地键值存储能力，支持按命名空间隔离的数据存取、批量操作、TTL 过期、数据导入导出、存储空间统计等功能。适用于应用配置和轻量数据持久化。",
    "en-US": "Local key-value storage with namespace isolation, batch operations, TTL expiry, import/export, and storage statistics. Suitable for app configuration and lightweight data persistence."
  },
